<title>USA: Clark Cty SD 114, Wash., yields 5.65 pct in 2015.</title>
<headline>Clark Cty SD 114, Wash., yields 5.65 pct in 2015.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
